        "7087": {"synopsis":"After the wait: each string's current length less the time waited; one at 0 ends its note\n(volume 0, MIDI_NOTE_OFF) and goes on to its next tied length or, with none left, its next\nnote (PLAY_NEXT), which is started (PLAY_SOUND) and marked in IY + 42; then a short wait,\nand the new notes' volumes and MIDI note on.","comment":"No new notes yet (IY + 42)"},
