        "7300": {"synopsis":"The AY tone periods for notes 21 up (note 21 first, $0FBF; notes below 21 get $0FBE from\nPLAY_SOUND's code; note 22's is $0EDC), one word each; note 60's is $01A8."},
        "7516": {"synopsis":"A MIDI note on for the string, when it has a MIDI channel: $90 + the channel, the note, the\nvelocity (the volume x 8, bit 4 cleared), each through MIDI_OUT.","comment":"A MIDI channel (bit 7 clear)?"},
