        "7569": {"synopsis":"Sends byte A out of the AY's I/O port A (register 14), one bit at a time with fixed delays:\na start bit ($FA), the eight bits low first ($FE for a 1, $FA for a 0), a stop bit ($FE).","comment":"L = the byte"},
