        "7641": {"synopsis":"FORMAT TO u,n[,m] (from FORMAT_CMD at $027B): lays out a new partition table on hard disk\nunit u. Three numbers (ROM 3's CLASS_6), the third optional ($5B66 bit 6 set when it is\nthere; report C without the ','); the statement's end; running, the lower screen opened\n(ROM 3's CHAN_OPEN with A = 1) and FORMAT_TO_RUN.","comment":"Past TO"},
        "7642": {"comment":"ROM 3's CLASS_6: the unit"},
        "7645": {"comment":"ROM 3's GET_CHAR: ','?"},
        "7648": {"comment":"No: report C"},
        "7651": {"comment":"Past it"},
