        "7682": {"comment":"Past LINE (ROM 3's NEXT_SKIP)","synopsis":"FORMAT LINE n (from FORMAT_CMD at $0276): past LINE, then FORMAT_LINE_BAUD."},
        "7685": {"synopsis":"FORMAT LINE n: the number (ROM 3's CLASS_6); running, kept at $5B5F; the statement's end,\nthen FORMAT_SET looks the rate up.\nObserved (v4.1): FORMAT LINE 2400 gave 0 OK and changed $5B5F from 11 to 54.","comment":"The rate (ROM 3's CLASS_6)"},
        "7688": {"comment":"Running?"},
